; --- THE DRIFT FLEET (REQ-036) -----------------------------
; Declared in the manifest, placed here. Deliberately OFF the
; walked route: the walk probe measures checkpoint segments
; against max_retry_seconds, and an entangling unit standing on
; that line would fail a completability probe for a reason that
; has nothing to do with completability. A player who leaves the
; line meets them.

